00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Broken Lullaby is a drama film directed by Ernst Lubitsch.

3
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:21,000
A young French soldier in World War I is overcome with guilt when he kills a German soldier who, like himself,
is a musically gifted conscript, each having attended the same musical conservatory in France.

4
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:06,000
The fact that the incident occurred in war does not assuage his guilt.

5
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:51,000
He travels to Germany to meet the man's family.

